{
  "schema": "summit.localization-catalog/v1",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-TW",
  "fallback_locale": "en",
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "npc.navisko_warehouse.chat.1",
      "text": "不要指望我會提供免費服務。",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.navisko_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "key": "npc.navisko_warehouse.name",
      "text": "倉庫管理員",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.navisko_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "key": "npc.ricarden_civilian2.chat.1",
      "text": "先前發現的古代監獄已經變成了怪物的巢穴，國王已經下令要消滅它們。",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.ricarden_civilian2"
    },
    {
      "key": "npc.ricarden_civilian2.name",
      "text": "愛管閒事的凱丁",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.ricarden_civilian2"
    },
    {
      "key": "npc.ricarden_civilian3.chat.1",
      "text": "沿著樹林往前走有一個怪獸出沒的小山丘，我很害怕。",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.ricarden_civilian3"
    },
    {
      "key": "npc.ricarden_civilian3.name",
      "text": "苦惱的扎昆",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.ricarden_civilian3"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.bockdol2.chat.1",
      "text": "準備一下自己需要的東西.",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.bockdol2"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.bockdol2.name",
      "text": "福童",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.bockdol2"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.navisko_civilian1.chat.1",
      "text": "昨晚我好像看到殭屍了，不過不知道是做夢還是真的，村子裡一定發生了奇怪的事情，真可怕。。。",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.navisko_civilian1"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.navisko_civilian1.name",
      "text": "膽小鬼里斯",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.navisko_civilian1"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.navisko_civilian3.chat.1",
      "text": "不知昨晚發生了什麼，早上醒來發現我的衣服都爛掉了，像抹布一樣，似乎我忘記了什麼事情。。。",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.navisko_civilian3"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.navisko_civilian3.name",
      "text": "健忘的昆塔",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.navisko_civilian3"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.nevisko_magic.chat.1",
      "text": "這裡是魔倫先生的第3號魔法商店,開業不久今後請多多關照!",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.nevisko_magic"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.nevisko_magic.name",
      "text": "魔倫魔法3號店",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.nevisko_magic"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.ricarden_arcane.chat.1",
      "text": "武器上注入寶石神秘的能量,就會發揮出它潛在的新力量.古代人稱它為昇華.",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.ricarden_arcane"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.ricarden_arcane.name",
      "text": "神秘的巴雲",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.ricarden_arcane"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.ricarden_dragoman.chat.1",
      "text": "有人說在沙漠裡的內維斯克發生了奇怪的事情，你也要去看看嗎，不過只有很強壯的戰士才能通過沙漠。",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.ricarden_dragoman"
    },
    {
      "key": "text.ricarden_dragoman.name",
      "text": "導遊",
      "quality": "translated",
      "source": "text.ricarden_dragoman"
    }
  ]
}
